  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "My smallish 1.8GB production backup wouldn't restore.  Since I can't share it, I tried the sample datasets and found that LUBM.tar.gz ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
