  "description": "<p>My smallish 1.8GB production backup wouldn't restore.  Since I can't share it, I tried the sample datasets and found that LUBM.tar.gz <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/blob/master/additional_datasets/lubm/LUBM.tar.gz\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/blob/master/additional_datasets/lubm/LUBM.tar.gz</a> also doesn't restore.</p>\n\n<p>ERROR 10:34:31.031 (FedoraRepositoryRestore) Problems restoring up the repository:<br/>\nERROR 10:34:31.034 (FedoraRepositoryRestore) java.sql.BatchUpdateException: Duplicate entry '87a0a8c317f1e7jcr:system/mode:metadata' for key 'PRIMARY'</p>\n",
